## 3. User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **MULTI-AGENT ARCHITECTURE CONFIRMATION**
> All new agents (Risk Assessment, Collection Follow-Up, Document Intelligence) utilize Groq LLM tool calling with fallback heuristic rule engines to guarantee system stability if API rate limits occur.
> No schema changes to the **12-Table Frozen ER Schema** are required — new agent outputs leverage existing tables (`reconciliation_cases`, `ai_recommendations`, `documents`, `audit_logs`, `notifications`).

